    {
      "id": "review_step2",
      "attached_node": "review",
      "text": "2. OVERLAY DOES NOT MEASURE COLOCALIZATION\nSwitch to Overlay or choose Image A + Image B in a pane. Change each input's black/white level and opacity; raw values and scientific caches remain unchanged. Yellow overlap is a visual cue, not a colocalization result.",
